nt view RGB, task name, and robot state, then returns a 7-dimensional action vector.\n\nWriting the A1 wrapper...\n\nMy plan is to clone the A1 repository, download the model, create the wrapper implementation, integrate it into evaluate.py as a model option, and run the evaluation. Let me start by setting up the repo and model in parallel, then verify that LIBERO is properly installed before proceeding.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1588,"cache_read_input_tokens":42493,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1588},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c17cc54a-0280-4c5b-a8fd-85ace094e8cd","uuid":"ce3da05a-9509-45f2-be9a-218b30bc4e26"}
