{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01B5B8yuW54CMNx1nUs64JBk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The action stats have a mask with 7 values, and the last one (gripper) is False (not normalized). This matches the expected behavior — the gripper dimension is not normalized by BOUNDS_Q99, it's handled separately.\n\nSo:\n- proprio stats: 8D, no mask (all values normalized)\n- action stats: 7D (we already truncate to 7), mask=[True,True,True,True,True,True,False] — gripper not normalized\n\nThe `unnormalize_actions_bounds_q99` uses `mask` from the stats and it has a `mask` field. \n\nThe A1 model outputs 32D actions which get truncated to the first 7 dimensions, matching the 7D action stats bounds used for unnormalization. The mask correctly marks the gripper (the 7th value) as False so it skips unnormalization and gets handled separately through `process_action`.\n\nNow I'll sync the changes and relaunch to test.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":355,"cache_read_input_tokens":116796,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":355},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c17cc54a-0280-4c5b-a8fd-85ace094e8cd","uuid":"36c75880-16a3-4351-81ad-69618033648c"}
